## New affected verdict

H1 RESOLVED: the authorized crop provides sufficient visible evidence to
classify the depicted upper-right arc as SOLID/CONTINUOUS, not intentionally
dash-separated. This is a new, narrowly affected source-style determination,
not a rewrite of the first HOLD and not whole-figure or product approval.

The decisive observation is a traceable curved black outline, including the
upper segment before it enters the hatched cap. Its uneven thickness and small
edge irregularities do not partition it into separate dashes. White hatch
interspaces lie inside the cap, and broken neighboring grid strokes lie
off the circular outline. Neither is a demonstrated gap in the arc.

